  "title": "Namibia: TotalEnergies Expands its Exploration Portfolio as Operator of PEL104 License",
  "summary": "Paris, February 6, 2026 – TotalEnergies has signed agreements to acquire a 42.5% operated interest in PEL104 Exploration license, located offshore Namibia, from Eight Offshore Investments Holdings (“Eight”) and Maravilla Oil & Gas. Upon completion of the transaction, TotalEnergies will be the operator of the license holding a 42.5% interest alongside Petrobras (42.5%), Namcor (10%) […]",
